{
  "slug": "breakout",
  "name": "벽돌깨기",
  "keywords": [
    "벽돌깨기",
    "벽돌 깨기",
    "벽돌",
    "breakout",
    "brick",
    "블록깨기"
  ],
  "prompt": "클래식 벽돌깨기 게임을 만들어줘. 패들로 공을 튕겨 벽돌을 깨고, 스테이지 3개, 목숨 3개, 점수와 최고점, 파워업(패들 확대) 하나. 파스텔 톤 스타일.",
  "description": "클래식 벽돌깨기 게임을 만들었어요. 3개의 스테이지(난이도 상승, 일부 단단한 벽돌 포함), 목숨 3개, 점수/최고점수(로컬저장), 패들이 커지는 파워업 캡슐, 파스텔 톤 벽돌 컬러를 구현했습니다. PC는 키보드/마우스, 모바일은 화면 하단 좌우 이동 버튼과 발사 버튼(또는 캔버스 터치 드래그)으로 조작할 수 있어요.",
  "html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"ko\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1, user-scalable=no\">\n<title>네온 브레이커</title>\n<style>\n  html, body {\n    margin: 0; padding: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%;\n    background: #000; overflow: hidden;\n    touch-action: none;\n    -webkit-user-select: none; user-select: none;\n    font-family: 'Segoe UI', sans-serif;\n  }\n  #wrap {\n    position: fixed; inset: 0;\n    background: #05010f;\n  }\n  #gameCanvas {\n    background: #05010f;\n    display: block;\n    touch-action: none;\n    position: absolute;\n    left: 0; top: 0;\n  }\n  .btn {\n    position: fixed;\n    bottom: 18px;\n    width: 62px; height: 62px;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    background: rgba(0,255,255,0.10);\n    border: 2px solid rgba(0,255,255,0.55);\n    box-shadow: 0 0 12px rgba(0,255,255,0.4);\n    color: #fff;\n    text-shadow: 0 0 6px #0ff;\n    font-size: 26px;\n    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;\n    touch-action: none;\n    -webkit-user-select: none; user-select: none;\n    z-index: 10;\n  }\n  .btn:active { background: rgba(0,255,255,0.4); }\n  #leftBtn { left: 18px; }\n  #rightBtn { left: 92px; }\n  #actionBtn { right: 18px; width: 78px; height: 78px; font-size: 15px; }\n  #touchControls { display: none; }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div id=\"wrap\">\n  <canvas id=\"gameCanvas\"></canvas>\n</div>\n<div id=\"touchControls\">\n  <div class=\"btn\" id=\"leftBtn\">◀</div>\n  <div class=\"btn\" id=\"rightBtn\">▶</div>\n  <div class=\"btn\" id=\"actionBtn\">발사</div>\n</div>\n\n<script>\n(function(){\n  let GAME_W = 480, GAME_H = 640;\n  const canvas = document.getElementById('gameCanvas');\n  const ctx = canvas.getContext('2d');\n\n  const isTouch = ('ontouchstart' in window) || navigator.maxTouchPoints > 0;\n  if (isTouch) document.getElementById('touchControls').style.display = 'block';\n\n  // ---------- 색상 팔레트 (네온) ----------\n  const PASTELS = ['#00F0FF','#FF2FD0','#7CFF6B','#FFE156','#B14BFF','#FF5C5C','#3DFFB0'];\n  const HARD_COLOR = '#3A4A7A';\n  const HARD_DAMAGED = '#6A7EC7';\n\n  let state = 'start';\n  let score = 0;\n  let highScore = 0;\n  try { highScore = parseInt(localStorage.getItem('brickHighScore') || '0'); } catch(e){}\n  let lives = 3;\n  let stage = 1;\n  const MAX_STAGE = 3;\n\n  const paddle = {\n    w: 80, h: 14, baseW: 80, bigW: 130,\n    x: 200, y: 600,\n    speed: 480,\n    powerTimer: 0\n  };\n\n  const ball = {\n    x: 0, y: 0, r: 8,\n    dx: 0, dy: 0, speed: 260,\n    attached: true\n  };\n\n  let bricks = [];\n  const cols = 8;\n  const brickPad = 6;\n  let brickW = 50;\n  const brickH = 22;\n\n  let powerups = [];\n\n  function buildStage(s, keepPowerups){\n    bricks = [];\n    if (!keepPowerups) powerups = [];\n    let rows = 3 + s;\n    let offsetLeft = 20;\n    let offsetTop = 60;\n    brickW = (GAME_W - 40 - (cols-1)*brickPad) / cols;\n    for (let r = 0; r < rows; r++){\n      for (let c = 0; c < cols; c++){\n        let hard = false;\n        if (s === 3 && r < 2) hard = true;\n        if (s === 2 && r === 0 && Math.random() < 0.4) hard = true;\n        bricks.push({\n          x: offsetLeft + c*(brickW+brickPad),\n          y: offsetTop + r*(brickH+brickPad),\n          w: brickW, h: brickH,\n          alive: true,\n          hp: hard ? 2 : 1,\n          maxHp: hard ? 2 : 1,\n          color: hard ? HARD_COLOR : PASTELS[(r+c) % PASTELS.length]\n        });\n      }\n    }\n  }\n\n  function layoutForSize(){\n    paddle.y = GAME_H - 40;\n    if (paddle.x + paddle.w > GAME_W) paddle.x = GAME_W - paddle.w;\n    if (paddle.x < 0) paddle.x = 0;\n    if (bricks.length) buildStage(stage, true);\n    if (ball.attached) resetBallOnPaddle();\n  }\n\n  function resize(){\n    const dpr = Math.min(window.devicePixelRatio || 1, 3);\n    const ww = window.innerWidth, wh = window.innerHeight;\n    // 화면 비율에 맞춰 논리 좌표계를 다시 잡아 레터박스 없이 화면을 꽉 채운다\n    const targetRatio = 480 / 640;\n    const winRatio = ww / wh;\n    if (winRatio > targetRatio) {\n      GAME_H = 640;\n      GAME_W = Math.round(640 * winRatio);\n    } else {\n      GAME_W = 480;\n      GAME_H = Math.round(480 / winRatio);\n    }\n    canvas.width = Math.round(ww * dpr);\n    canvas.height = Math.round(wh * dpr);\n    canvas.style.width = ww + 'px';\n    canvas.style.height = wh + 'px';\n    ctx.setTransform(dpr * (ww / GAME_W), 0, 0, dpr * (wh / GAME_H), 0, 0);\n    layoutForSize();\n  }\n  window.addEventListener('resize', resize);\n  window.addEventListener('orientationchange', resize);\n\n  function resetBallOnPaddle(){\n    ball.attached = true;\n    ball.x = paddle.x + paddle.w/2;\n    ball.y = paddle.y - ball.r - 1;\n    ball.dx = 0;\n    ball.dy = 0;\n    ball.speed = 260 + (stage-1)*40;\n  }\n\n  function launchBall(){\n    if (!ball.attached) return;\n    ball.attached = false;\n    const angle = (-Math.PI/2) + (Math.random()*0.6 - 0.3);\n    ball.dx = Math.cos(angle) * ball.speed;\n    ball.dy = Math.sin(angle) * ball.speed;\n  }\n\n  function startGame(){\n    score = 0;\n    lives = 3;\n    stage = 1;\n    paddle.w = paddle.baseW;\n    paddle.powerTimer = 0;\n    paddle.x = GAME_W/2 - paddle.w/2;\n    buildStage(stage);\n    resetBallOnPaddle();\n    state = 'playing';\n    if (window.AJ) AJ.start();\n  }\n\n  function nextStage(){\n    stage++;\n    if (stage > MAX_STAGE){\n      state = 'win';\n      return;\n    }\n    paddle.w = paddle.baseW;\n    paddle.powerTimer = 0;\n    paddle.x = GAME_W/2 - paddle.w/2;\n    buildStage(stage);\n    resetBallOnPaddle();\n    state = 'playing';\n    if (window.AJ) AJ.level(stage);\n  }\n\n  function loseLife(){\n    lives--;\n    if (lives <= 0){\n      state = 'gameover';\n      if (score > highScore){\n        highScore = score;\n        try { localStorage.setItem('brickHighScore', String(highScore)); } catch(e){}\n      }\n    } else {\n      resetBallOnPaddle();\n    }\n  }\n\n  const keys = {};\n  window.addEventListener('keydown', e => {\n    keys[e.key] = true;\n    if (e.key === ' ' || e.key === 'ArrowUp' || e.code === 'Space'){\n      handleAction();\n      e.preventDefault();\n    }\n    if (e.code === 'ArrowLeft' || e.code === 'ArrowRight') e.preventDefault();\n  });\n  window.addEventListener('keyup', e => { keys[e.key] = false; });\n\n  function handleAction(){\n    if (state === 'start') startGame();\n    else if (state === 'playing') launchBall();\n    else if (state === 'stageClear') nextStage();\n    else if (state === 'gameover' || state === 'win') { startGame(); if (window.AJ) AJ.restart(); }\n  }\n\n  function toGameCoord(clientX, clientY){\n    const rect = canvas.getBoundingClientRect();\n    return {\n      x: (clientX - rect.left) / rect.width * GAME_W,\n      y: (clientY - rect.top) / rect.height * GAME_H\n    };\n  }\n\n  canvas.addEventListener('mousedown', () => handleAction());\n  canvas.addEventListener('mousemove', e => {\n    const p = toGameCoord(e.clientX, e.clientY);\n    paddle.x = p.x - paddle.w/2;\n  });\n\n  canvas.addEventListener('touchmove', e => {\n    e.preventDefault();\n    const t = e.touches[0];\n    const p = toGameCoord(t.clientX, t.clientY);\n    paddle.x = p.x - paddle.w/2;\n  }, {passive:false});\n  canvas.addEventListener('touchstart', e => {\n    e.preventDefault();\n    handleAction();\n  }, {passive:false});\n\n  let touchLeft = false, touchRight = false;\n  function bindBtn(id, onDown, onUp){\n    const el = document.getElementById(id);\n    el.addEventListener('pointerdown', e => { e.preventDefault(); onDown(); });\n    el.addEventListener('pointerup', e => { e.preventDefault(); onUp && onUp(); });\n    el.addEventListener('pointercancel', e => { onUp && onUp(); });\n    el.addEventListener('pointerleave', e => { onUp && onUp(); });\n    el.addEventListener('contextmenu', e => e.preventDefault());\n  }\n  bindBtn('leftBtn', () => touchLeft = true, () => touchLeft = false);\n  bindBtn('rightBtn', () => touchRight = true, () => touchRight = false);\n  bindBtn('actionBtn', () => handleAction());\n\n  let lastTime = performance.now();\n  function loop(now){\n    const dt = Math.min((now - lastTime) / 1000, 0.033);\n    lastTime = now;\n    update(dt);\n    render();\n    requestAnimationFrame(loop);\n  }\n\n  function update(dt){\n    if (state !== 'playing') return;\n\n    let dir = 0;\n    if (keys['ArrowLeft'] || keys['a'] || keys['A'] || touchLeft) dir -= 1;\n    if (keys['ArrowRight'] || keys['d'] || keys['D'] || touchRight) dir += 1;\n    paddle.x += dir * paddle.speed * dt;\n    paddle.x = Math.max(0, Math.min(GAME_W - paddle.w, paddle.x));\n\n    if (paddle.powerTimer > 0){\n      paddle.powerTimer -= dt;\n      if (paddle.powerTimer <= 0){\n        paddle.w = paddle.baseW;\n        if (paddle.x + paddle.w > GAME_W) paddle.x = GAME_W - paddle.w;\n      }\n    }\n\n    if (ball.attached){\n      ball.x = paddle.x + paddle.w/2;\n      ball.y = paddle.y - ball.r - 1;\n    } else {\n      ball.x += ball.dx * dt;\n      ball.y += ball.dy * dt;\n\n      if (ball.x - ball.r < 0){ ball.x = ball.r; ball.dx *= -1; }\n      if (ball.x + ball.r > GAME_W){ ball.x = GAME_W - ball.r; ball.dx *= -1; }\n      if (ball.y - ball.r < 0){ ball.y = ball.r; ball.dy *= -1; }\n\n      if (ball.dy > 0 &&\n          ball.y + ball.r >= paddle.y &&\n          ball.y + ball.r <= paddle.y + paddle.h + 10 &&\n          ball.x >= paddle.x && ball.x <= paddle.x + paddle.w){\n        ball.y = paddle.y - ball.r;\n        const hitPos = (ball.x - (paddle.x + paddle.w/2)) / (paddle.w/2);\n        const angle = hitPos * (Math.PI/3) - Math.PI/2;\n        const speed = Math.hypot(ball.dx, ball.dy);\n        ball.dx = Math.cos(angle) * speed;\n        ball.dy = Math.sin(angle) * speed;\n      }\n\n      if (ball.y - ball.r > GAME_H){\n        loseLife();\n      }\n\n      for (let b of bricks){\n        if (!b.alive) continue;\n        if (ball.x + ball.r > b.x && ball.x - ball.r < b.x + b.w &&\n            ball.y + ball.r > b.y && ball.y - ball.r < b.y + b.h){\n          const overlapX = Math.min(ball.x + ball.r - b.x, b.x + b.w - (ball.x - ball.r));\n          const overlapY = Math.min(ball.y + ball.r - b.y, b.y + b.h - (ball.y - ball.r));\n          if (overlapX < overlapY){\n            ball.dx *= -1;\n          } else {\n            ball.dy *= -1;\n          }\n          b.hp--;\n          if (b.hp <= 0){\n            b.alive = false;\n            score += 10 * stage;\n            if (window.AJ) AJ.score(score);\n            if (Math.random() < 0.15){\n              powerups.push({ x: b.x + b.w/2, y: b.y + b.h/2, r: 10, dy: 120 });\n            }\n          } else {\n            b.color = HARD_DAMAGED;\n          }\n          break;\n        }\n      }\n\n      if (bricks.every(b => !b.alive)){\n        state = 'stageClear';\n      }\n    }\n\n    for (let i = powerups.length - 1; i >= 0; i--){\n      const p = powerups[i];\n      p.y += p.dy * dt;\n      if (p.y - p.r > GAME_H){\n        powerups.splice(i,1);\n        continue;\n      }\n      if (p.y + p.r >= paddle.y && p.y - p.r <= paddle.y + paddle.h &&\n          p.x >= paddle.x && p.x <= paddle.x + paddle.w){\n        paddle.w = paddle.bigW;\n        paddle.powerTimer = 8;\n        if (paddle.x + paddle.w > GAME_W) paddle.x = GAME_W - paddle.w;\n        powerups.splice(i,1);\n      }\n    }\n\n    if (score > highScore) highScore = score;\n  }\n\n  // ---------- 배경 그리드/스캔라인 ----------\n  let gridPhase = 0;\n  function drawBackdrop(){\n    const grad = ctx.createLinearGradient(0,0,0,GAME_H);\n    grad.addColorStop(0, '#0a0420');\n    grad.addColorStop(0.5, '#0d0630');\n    grad.addColorStop(1, '#05010f');\n    ctx.fillStyle = grad;\n    ctx.fillRect(0,0,GAME_W,GAME_H);\n\n    gridPhase += 0.15;\n    ctx.save();\n    ctx.strokeStyle = 'rgba(0,220,255,0.10)';\n    ctx.lineWidth = 1;\n    const gap = 32;\n    const off = gridPhase % gap;\n    for (let x = -gap; x < GAME_W+gap; x += gap){\n      ctx.beginPath(); ctx.moveTo(x+off, 0); ctx.lineTo(x+off, GAME_H); ctx.stroke();\n    }\n    for (let y = 0; y < GAME_H; y += gap){\n      ctx.beginPath(); ctx.moveTo(0, y); ctx.lineTo(GAME_W, y); ctx.stroke();\n    }\n    ctx.restore();\n\n    ctx.save();\n    ctx.globalAlpha = 0.05;\n    ctx.fillStyle = '#00f0ff';\n    for (let y = 0; y < GAME_H; y += 4){ ctx.fillRect(0, y, GAME_W, 1); }\n    ctx.restore();\n  }\n\n  function shadeColor(hex, amt){\n    var c = hex.replace('#','');\n    if (c.length === 3) c = c[0]+c[0]+c[1]+c[1]+c[2]+c[2];\n    var num = parseInt(c,16);\n    if (isNaN(num)) return hex;\n    var r = Math.max(0,Math.min(255, (num>>16)+amt));\n    var g = Math.max(0,Math.min(255, ((num>>8)&0xff)+amt));\n    var b = Math.max(0,Math.min(255, (num&0xff)+amt));\n    return 'rgb('+r+','+g+','+b+')';\n  }\n\n  function neonRect(x,y,w,h,r,color,glow){\n    const depth = Math.max(3, Math.min(7, h*0.3));\n\n    // 돌출된 입체감을 위한 뒤쪽 측면(어두운 면)\n    ctx.save();\n    ctx.globalAlpha = 0.9;\n    ctx.fillStyle = shadeColor(color, -70);\n    roundRect(x+depth*0.55, y+depth, w, h, r);\n    ctx.fill();\n    ctx.restore();\n\n    // 앞면 - 입체감 있는 그라데이션\n    ctx.save();\n    ctx.shadowColor = color;\n    ctx.shadowBlur = glow || 14;\n    const grad = ctx.createLinearGradient(x, y, x, y+h);\n    grad.addColorStop(0, shadeColor(color, 55));\n    grad.addColorStop(0.45, color);\n    grad.addColorStop(1, shadeColor(color, -40));\n    ctx.fillStyle = grad;\n    roundRect(x,y,w,h,r);\n    ctx.fill();\n    ctx.restore();\n\n    // 좌측 입체 하이라이트\n    ctx.save();\n    ctx.globalAlpha = 0.35;\n    ctx.fillStyle = '#ffffff';\n    roundRect(x, y, Math.max(3,w*0.14), h, r);\n    ctx.fill();\n    ctx.restore();\n\n    // 상단 하이라이트 라인 (유리 질감)\n    ctx.save();\n    ctx.globalAlpha = 0.6;\n    ctx.strokeStyle = 'rgba(255,255,255,0.85)';\n    ctx.lineWidth = 1.5;\n    ctx.beginPath();\n    ctx.moveTo(x+r, y+1.5);\n    ctx.lineTo(x+w-r, y+1.5);\n    ctx.stroke();\n    ctx.restore();\n\n    ctx.strokeStyle = 'rgba(255,255,255,0.55)';\n    ctx.lineWidth = 1.2;\n    roundRect(x,y,w,h,r);\n    ctx.stroke();\n  }\n\n  function neonText(text, x, y, size, color, align){\n    ctx.textAlign = align || 'center';\n    ctx.font = \"bold \" + size + \"px 'Segoe UI', sans-serif\";\n    ctx.shadowColor = color;\n    ctx.shadowBlur = 16;\n    ctx.fillStyle = color;\n    ctx.fillText(text, x, y);\n    ctx.shadowBlur = 0;\n  }\n\n  function render(){\n    ctx.clearRect(0,0,GAME_W,GAME_H);\n    drawBackdrop();\n\n    if (state === 'start'){\n      drawCenterScreen('⚡ 네온 브레이커', ['스페이스 / 클릭 / 발사 버튼으로 시작'], '#00F0FF');\n      drawHighScore();\n      return;\n    }\n\n    for (let b of bricks){\n      if (!b.alive) continue;\n      neonRect(b.x, b.y, b.w, b.h, 5, b.color, 10);\n    }\n\n    for (let p of powerups){\n      ctx.save();\n      ctx.shadowColor = '#FFE156';\n      ctx.shadowBlur = 14;\n      ctx.beginPath();\n      ctx.fillStyle = '#FFE156';\n      ctx.arc(p.x, p.y, p.r, 0, Math.PI*2);\n      ctx.fill();\n      ctx.restore();\n      ctx.fillStyle = '#3a2e00';\n      ctx.font = 'bold 12px sans-serif';\n      ctx.textAlign = 'center';\n      ctx.fillText('P', p.x, p.y+4);\n    }\n\n    neonRect(paddle.x, paddle.y, paddle.w, paddle.h, 7, '#00E5FF', 20);\n\n    ctx.save();\n    ctx.shadowColor = '#FF2FD0';\n    ctx.shadowBlur = 20;\n    const bg = ctx.createRadialGradient(\n      ball.x - ball.r*0.35, ball.y - ball.r*0.4, ball.r*0.1,\n      ball.x, ball.y, ball.r\n    );\n    bg.addColorStop(0, '#ffffff');\n    bg.addColorStop(0.35, '#FFC7F5');\n    bg.addColorStop(1, '#D80FA8');\n    ctx.beginPath();\n    ctx.fillStyle = bg;\n    ctx.arc(ball.x, ball.y, ball.r, 0, Math.PI*2);\n    ctx.fill();\n    ctx.restore();\n\n    drawHUD();\n\n    if (state === 'stageClear'){\n      drawCenterScreen('스테이지 ' + stage + ' 클리어!', ['탭 / 스페이스로 다음 스테이지'], '#7CFF6B');\n    } else if (state === 'gameover'){\n      drawCenterScreen('게임 오버', ['점수: ' + score, '탭 / 스페이스로 재시작'], '#FF5C7A');\n    } else if (state === 'win'){\n      drawCenterScreen('🎉 클리어! 🎉', ['최종 점수: ' + score, '탭 / 스페이스로 재시작'], '#FFE156');\n    }\n  }\n\n  function roundRect(x,y,w,h,r){\n    ctx.beginPath();\n    ctx.moveTo(x+r, y);\n    ctx.arcTo(x+w, y, x+w, y+h, r);\n    ctx.arcTo(x+w, y+h, x, y+h, r);\n    ctx.arcTo(x, y+h, x, y, r);\n    ctx.arcTo(x, y, x+w, y, r);\n    ctx.closePath();\n  }\n\n  function drawHUD(){\n    neonText('SCORE ' + score, 12, 26, 16, '#00F0FF', 'left');\n    neonText('BEST ' + highScore, 12, 46, 13, '#3DFFB0', 'left');\n\n    neonText('STAGE ' + stage + '/' + MAX_STAGE, GAME_W - 12, 26, 15, '#B14BFF', 'right');\n\n    ctx.textAlign = 'right';\n    let heartStr = '';\n    for (let i=0;i<lives;i++) heartStr += '♥';\n    ctx.save();\n    ctx.shadowColor = '#FF2F6D';\n    ctx.shadowBlur = 12;\n    ctx.font = '18px sans-serif';\n    ctx.fillStyle = '#FF2F6D';\n    ctx.fillText(heartStr, GAME_W - 12, 46);\n    ctx.restore();\n  }\n\n  function drawHighScore(){\n    neonText('BEST ' + highScore, GAME_W/2, GAME_H/2 + 70, 16, '#3DFFB0', 'center');\n  }\n\n  function drawCenterScreen(title, lines, color){\n    ctx.save();\n    ctx.fillStyle = 'rgba(5,1,20,0.78)';\n    ctx.fillRect(0, GAME_H/2 - 100, GAME_W, 200);\n    ctx.strokeStyle = 'rgba(0,240,255,0.4)';\n    ctx.lineWidth = 1.5;\n    ctx.strokeRect(0, GAME_H/2 - 100, GAME_W, 200);\n    ctx.restore();\n\n    neonText(title, GAME_W/2, GAME_H/2 - 25, 28, color, 'center');\n    ctx.font = '15px sans-serif';\n    ctx.fillStyle = '#CFEFFF';\n    ctx.shadowBlur = 0;\n    ctx.textAlign = 'center';\n    lines.forEach((line, i) => {\n      ctx.fillText(line, GAME_W/2, GAME_H/2 + 15 + i*24);\n    });\n  }\n\n  resize();\n  requestAnimationFrame(loop);\n\n  // ==== VIBREX 표준 매니페스트 + 완성형 봇 ====\n  (function(){\n    var skill=0.3,botOn=false,botTimer=null,aimErr=0;\n    function predictX(){\n      if(ball.attached)return paddle.x+paddle.w/2;\n      if(ball.dy<=0)return ball.x;\n      var x=ball.x,y=ball.y,dx=ball.dx,dy=ball.dy,steps=0;\n      while(y<paddle.y-ball.r&&steps++<400){var t=0.016;x+=dx*t;y+=dy*t;if(x<ball.r){x=ball.r;dx=-dx}if(x>GAME_W-ball.r){x=GAME_W-ball.r;dx=-dx}}\n      return x;\n    }\n    function tick(){\n      if(!botOn)return;\n      if(state!=='playing'){handleAction();aimErr=(Math.random()-0.5)*2*(1-skill)*70;return}\n      if(ball.attached){if(Math.random()<0.3+skill*0.5)launchBall();return}\n      var tx=predictX()+aimErr*(1-Math.min(1,skill+0.15));\n      if(skill>0.6&&ball.dy>0){var leftB=0,rightB=0;for(var i=0;i<bricks.length;i++){if(!bricks[i].alive)continue;(bricks[i].x<GAME_W/2?leftB++:rightB++)}tx+=(leftB>rightB?-1:1)*paddle.w*0.28}\n      var c=paddle.x+paddle.w/2,dead=6+18*(1-skill);\n      keys['ArrowLeft']=false;keys['ArrowRight']=false;\n      if(tx<c-dead)keys['ArrowLeft']=true;else if(tx>c+dead)keys['ArrowRight']=true;\n    }\n    function botLoop(){if(!botOn)return;try{tick()}catch(e){}botTimer=setTimeout(botLoop,Math.max(30,150-110*skill))}\n    window.vibrexBot={start:function(){if(botOn)return;botOn=true;botLoop()},stop:function(){botOn=false;if(botTimer)clearTimeout(botTimer);keys['ArrowLeft']=false;keys['ArrowRight']=false},setSkill:function(s){if(typeof s==='number'&&isFinite(s))skill=Math.max(0,Math.min(1,s))}};\n    window.VIBREX_GAME={\n      title:'네온 브레이커',genre:'action',goal:'벽돌을 모두 깨고 3스테이지 클리어',clearCondition:'3스테이지 모두 클리어',\n      touchUI:'none',\n      controls:[{input:'ArrowLeft',action:'왼쪽'},{input:'ArrowRight',action:'오른쪽'},{input:'Space',action:'발사/시작'}],\n      buttons:{},\n      rules:['벽돌을 맞히면 점수를 얻고 벽돌이 사라진다','공이 패들 아래 바닥에 떨어지면 목숨을 잃는다','목숨을 모두 잃으면 게임오버','파워업 캡슐을 받으면 패들이 8초간 커진다','3스테이지를 모두 깨면 클리어'],\n      tips:['패들 중앙보다 가장자리로 맞히면 각도를 크게 꺾을 수 있다','안 깨진 벽돌이 몰린 쪽으로 각도를 조절하면 빨리 깬다','파워업은 놓치지 말고 받아 패들을 넓게 유지'],\n      stateDoc:{ballX:'공 x좌표',ballY:'공 y좌표',ballDx:'공 x속도',ballDy:'공 y속도',paddleX:'패들 중심 x',paddleW:'패들 너비',attached:'공이 패들에 붙어있는지 1/0',score:'점수',lives:'남은 목숨',stage:'현재 스테이지',bricksLeft:'남은 벽돌 수'},\n      phase:function(){return state==='gameover'?'over':state==='win'?'cleared':state==='playing'||state==='stageClear'?'playing':'title'},\n      progress:function(){return Math.min(1,((stage-1)+(1-bricks.filter(function(b){return b.alive}).length/Math.max(1,bricks.length)))/MAX_STAGE)},\n      state:function(){return{ballX:Math.round(ball.x),ballY:Math.round(ball.y),ballDx:Math.round(ball.dx),ballDy:Math.round(ball.dy),paddleX:Math.round(paddle.x+paddle.w/2),paddleW:paddle.w,attached:ball.attached?1:0,score:score,lives:lives,stage:stage,bricksLeft:bricks.filter(function(b){return b.alive}).length}},\n      start:function(){handleAction()},restart:function(){handleAction()},\n      inputs:{left:function(on){keys['ArrowLeft']=!!on},right:function(on){keys['ArrowRight']=!!on},fire:function(on){if(on)handleAction()}}\n    };\n    if(window.VIBREX_AVATAR){ /* 이 게임은 플레이어 스프라이트가 없어 아바타 반영 없음 */ }\n    var lastScore=0,sentOver=false,sentClear=false;\n    setInterval(function(){try{\n      if(score>lastScore){lastScore=score;window.AJ&&AJ.score(score)}\n      if(state==='gameover'&&!sentOver){sentOver=true;window.AJ&&AJ.over(score)}\n      if(state==='win'&&!sentClear){sentClear=true;window.AJ&&AJ.clear&&AJ.clear(score)}\n      if(state==='playing'){sentOver=false;sentClear=false}\n    }catch(e){}},600);\n  })();\n\n})();\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>"
}